{% set pageTitle = "Open Source — NinerLog" %}
{% set pageDescription = "NinerLog is 100% open source. See the code, self-host, or contribute. Your logbook, your rules." %}
{% set pagePath = "/open-source" %}
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block content %}

<!-- ============================================================
     HERO
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="relative bg-linear-to-br from-navy-900 via-navy-800 to-navy-950 py-16 lg:py-24 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-topo-pattern pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-center relative z-10">
    <div class="mb-4 reveal">
      <span class="freq-badge">
        <span class="inline-block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-blink"></span>
        AGPL-3.0 &amp; MIT &bull; 100% TRANSPARENT
      </span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white text-balance reveal reveal-delay-1">
      See the code. Own the code.<br class="hidden sm:block" /> Trust the code.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal reveal-delay-2">
      NinerLog is 100% open source. The API is licensed under AGPL-3.0, and all other components under the MIT license. Every line of code is public, auditable, and yours to inspect.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-sky-500/20 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     WHAT OPEN SOURCE MEANS
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="bg-white dark:bg-navy-950 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-6 reveal">
      What &ldquo;open source&rdquo; means for your logbook.
    </h2>
    <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none reveal reveal-delay-1">
      <p>
        Your pilot logbook is a legal document. It records your entire flying career &mdash; every hour, every landing, every license. You need to trust the platform that holds it.
      </p>
      <p>
        With NinerLog, that trust is built on transparency. Our source code is public on GitHub. Anyone can read it, audit it, and verify exactly how your data is stored, processed, and protected.
      </p>
      <p>
        Open source means <strong>no hidden data collection</strong>, <strong>no secret algorithms</strong>, and <strong>no vendor lock-in</strong>. If NinerLog ever disappeared tomorrow, you could take the code and run it yourself. Your logbook would keep working.
      </p>
      <p>
        That&rsquo;s the promise: <strong>your data is yours, forever.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     ARCHITECTURE
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800 dark:text-white reveal">
        NinerLog Architecture
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal reveal-delay-1">
        A modern, clean stack. No magic, no black boxes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8 relative">
      <!-- Connector arrows (desktop) -->
      <div class="hidden md:flex absolute top-1/2 left-1/3 -translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10">
        <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-sky-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="hidden md:flex absolute top-1/2 left-2/3 -translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10">
        <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-sky-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </div>

      <!-- Frontend -->
      <div class="p-6 bg-white dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl text-center reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-sky-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-sky-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="m9 8 6 4-6 4Z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-2">React + TypeScript</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">TailwindCSS, PWA / Mobile-first design. Fast, accessible, modern.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Backend -->
      <div class="p-6 bg-white dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl text-center reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m18 16 4-4-4-4"/><path d="m6 8-4 4 4 4"/><path d="m14.5 4-5 16"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-2">Go API Server</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">REST + JWT authentication. OpenAPI specification. Fast and reliable.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Database -->
      <div class="p-6 bg-white dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl text-center reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M3 5v14a9 3 0 0 0 18 0V5"/><path d="M3 12a9 3 0 0 0 18 0"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-2">PostgreSQL</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Versioned migrations. Your data stored safely and efficiently.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 text-center text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 reveal reveal-delay-4">
      <p>All code publicly available on GitHub &bull; AGPL-3.0 &amp; MIT &bull; Docker Compose for easy self-hosting</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

