      Self-host NinerLog.
    </h2>
    <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none reveal reveal-delay-1">
      <p>
        NinerLog ships with Docker Compose, so if you have Docker installed you can run your own instance in minutes &mdash; and if that&rsquo;s not your thing, the free hosted version at <a href="https://app.ninerlog.com" class="text-sky-500 hover:text-sky-400">app.ninerlog.com</a> is the same code with zero setup.
      </p>
      <p>
